#: templates/config.html.twig:96
msgid "Every 5 minutes, ask each GLPI Agent whether it is there (the \"status\" request of the agent page in GLPI); when it does not answer, or for an asset in a rack without agent (switch, PDU...), try a TCP connection to the ports below. A machine that stops answering is reported within minutes instead of after the missing-inventory threshold."
msgstr "每 5 分鐘問一次每台 GLPI Agent 是否還在（就是 GLPI agent 頁面上查狀態的那個請求）；agent 沒回應，或機櫃上沒有 agent 的設備（switch、PDU…），改試著連下列 TCP 埠。機器停止回應幾分鐘內就會通知，不用等到「沒回報」門檻。"

#: templates/config.html.twig:99
